span style='position:relative;z-index:251658240;left:-52px;\r\ntop:493px;width:994px;height:495px'><img width=795 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlh4gMCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAQDiAwEAgAAAAAAAAAIgRI6py+0Po5y02ouz3rz7D4biSJbmiabqyrbuC8cHUAAAOw==\"><\/span><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT\r\nOF RADIOLOGY &amp; IMAGING<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>ULTRASONOGRAPHY OF LOWER\r\nABDOMEN \/ KUB\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 - [MALE\/FEMALE]<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>================================================================<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>KIDNEYS:\r\n<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Right\r\nKidney:- ______ x _____\u00a0 mm (Approx).\u00a0 Left Kidney:- _____\u00a0 x _____\u00a0 mm\r\n(Approx). <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Both\r\nkidneys are normal in size, shape, outline and position. The cortical\r\nechotexture is normal with preserved cortico-medullary echodifferentiation.\r\nThere is no evidence of cystic lesion, renal calculi or hydronephrotic changes.\r\nPerirenal spaces are clear.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>URETERS:\r\nNot dilated hence not visualized.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>URINARY\r\nBLADDER: Prevoid:-\u00a0 Shows normal distension. The walls are regular. No Calculus\r\n\/ Growth \/ Sludge etc are seen in the walls or lumen. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Prevoid\r\nurinary bladder volume is _____ ml (approx.).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Post\r\nvoid: Post void residual urinary bladder volume is <b>increased<\/b>\/insignificant\r\n[ ____ ml (approx)].<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>=================================================================<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>UTERUS:\r\nAnteverted. Normal in shape and outline. The size is within normal limits <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>(________\r\nx _________ x ________ mm).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Myometrium:-\r\nNormal homogenous appearance. No myomatous lesion is seen. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Endometrium:-\r\nNormal in thickness [ _______\u00a0 mm] and brightness. The cavity is empty. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Cervix\r\nand vagina appears normal.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>ADNEXA:\u00a0\r\nThe fallopian tubes are not dilated. Both ovaries are normal in size and\r\nechopattern. No ovarian or adnexal SOL seen. Capsular outline is preserved. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Right\r\novary measures: _____\u00a0 x _____\u00a0 mm (approx).\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Left\r\novary measures: _____\u00a0 x _____\u00a0 mm (approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>POUCH\r\nOF DOUGLAS:- Clear. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>=================================================================<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>PROSTATE:\r\nThe size, outline and echotexture appear normal. No focal lesion is seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Approx.\r\nSize:- _____\u00a0 x _____\u00a0 x _____\u00a0 mm. Approx. Weight:- _____\u00a0 grams.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>IMPRESSION: No significant abnormality is seen in USG scanning\r\nof Lower Abdomen region.<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:9.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:8.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>DR. SOUMITRO BHATTACHARYA<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:6.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>MBBS,\r\nMD (RADIOLOGY)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:6.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>CONSULTANT\r\nRADIOLOGIST\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <\/span><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:7.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Cambria\",serif'>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:6.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>Regd\r\nNo. 55881 WBMC<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT\r\nOF RADIOLOGY &amp; IMAGING<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><b><u><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Cambria\",serif'>ULTRASONOGRAPHY\r\nOF LOWER ABDOMEN \/ KUB\u00a0 - [MALE\/FEMALE]<\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>KIDNEYS<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Both kidneys are normal in size, shape, outline and\r\nposition. Renal cortical echotexture is normal with preserved cortico-medullary\r\necho differentiation. There is no evidence of any solid or cystic lesion, no\r\nrenal calculi or hydronephrotic changes seen. Perirenal spaces are clear. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Right Kidney measures:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0cm (approx). <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Left Kidney measures: \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0cm (approx). <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>RIGHT KIDNEYS<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Right kidney is normal in size, shape, outline and\r\nposition. Renal cortical echotexture is normal with preserved cortico-medullary\r\necho differentiation. There is no evidence of any solid <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>or cystic lesion, no renal calculi or hydronephrotic\r\nchanges seen. Perirenal spaces are clear. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Right Kidney measures:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 cm. (approx). <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>LEFT KIDNEYS<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Right kidney is normal in size, shape, outline and\r\nposition. Renal cortical echotexture is normal with preserved cortico-medullary\r\necho differentiation. There is no evidence of any solid <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>or cystic lesion, no renal calculi or hydronephrotic\r\nchanges seen. Perirenal spaces are clear. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Left Kidney measures:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 cm. (approx). <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>URETERS<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Not dilated hence not visualized.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>URINARY BLADDER<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Prevoid: \u00a0Shows normal distension. The walls are\r\nregular. No Calculus \/ Growth \/ Sludge etc are seen in the walls or lumen. Prevoid\r\nurinary bladder volume is\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0ml (approx.) <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>POSTVOID:<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>-\u00a0 <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Post void residual urinary bladder volume is\r\nincreased \/ insignificant \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0ml (approx)].<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>UTERUS<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:- <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Anteverted. Normal in shape and outline. The size is\r\nwithin normal limits<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>measures :\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 cm). Myometrium:\r\nNormal homogenous appearance. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No myomatous lesion is seen. Endometrium\u00a0 normal in\r\nthickness \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0cm.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>and brightness. The cavity is empty. Cervix and\r\nvagina appears normal.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ADNEXA<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>: -<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>The fallopian tubes are not dilated. Both ovaries\r\nare normal in size and echopattern.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No ovarian or adnexal SOL seen. Capsular outline is\r\npreserved. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Right ovary measures:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 cm (approx). <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Left ovary measures:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 cm (approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>POUCH OF DOUGLAS<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Clear. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>PROSTATE<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>The size, outline and echotexture appear normal. No\r\nfocal lesion is seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>prostate measures:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0cm. approx.\r\nweight:- \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0grams.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ILIAC FOSSAE<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>: -<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No definite abnormality seen. Bilateral psoas\r\nshadows are normal. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No obvious collection \/ SOL seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>IMPRESSION<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>: <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No Significant Abnormality is seen in USG\r\n